const APPCH=[
 {k:'home',t:['Open the app','Fungua programu'],p:['The first screen answers three questions without a single tap: what is arriving, what is running low and how the family’s last check went. Six Care Zones mirror the store, coded A to F, so the app and the shelves speak the same language.','Skrini ya kwanza inajibu maswali matatu bila kubonyeza chochote: nini kinakuja, nini kinaisha na kipimo cha mwisho cha familia kilikuwaje. Kanda sita za Huduma zinafanana na duka, zenye herufi A hadi F, hivyo programu na rafu zinaongea lugha moja.'],w:['A returning customer reaches a reorder in one tap.','Mteja anayerudi anafikia kuagiza tena kwa kubonyeza mara moja.']},
 {k:'search',t:['Find it in their own words','Pata kwa maneno yao wenyewe'],p:['Search understands everyday Kiswahili and English: “presha”, “nepi”, “homa”. Every product page says who it is best for in plain words, shows the price with VAT and the Care Zone where it sits in the store.','Utafutaji unaelewa Kiswahili na Kiingereza cha kila siku: “presha”, “nepi”, “homa”. Kila ukurasa wa bidhaa unasema inamfaa nani kwa maneno rahisi, unaonyesha bei pamoja na VAT na Kanda ya Huduma ilipo dukani.'],w:['Customers buy with confidence, staff answer fewer basic questions.','Wateja wananunua kwa ujasiri, wafanyakazi wanajibu maswali machache ya msingi.']},
 {k:'cart',t:['Pay with the phone they already use','Lipa kwa simu wanayotumia tayari'],p:['Delivery or free click-and-collect, then one mobile-money prompt: the customer approves with their own PIN on their own phone. Afya Basics never sees or stores the PIN. The TRA e-receipt follows by SMS.','Kuletewa au kuchukua dukani bure, kisha ombi moja la pesa kwa simu: mteja anaidhinisha kwa PIN yake kwenye simu yake. Afya Basics haioni wala haihifadhi PIN. Risiti ya TRA inafuata kwa SMS.'],w:['No card needed, no cash at the door, no reconciliation by hand.','Hakuna kadi, hakuna pesa taslimu mlangoni, hakuna kulinganisha hesabu kwa mkono.']},
 {k:'track',t:['Know exactly where the order is','Jua oda iko wapi hasa'],p:['Each step is recorded by the system as it happens: paid, picked and scanned, packed and photographed, rider on the way, handed over with a four-digit code. The customer sees the same timeline the store sees.','Kila hatua inarekodiwa na mfumo inapotokea: imelipwa, imechukuliwa na kuskaniwa, imefungwa na kupigwa picha, msafirishaji yuko njiani, imekabidhiwa kwa namba ya siri ya tarakimu nne. Mteja anaona mstari ule ule wa matukio unaoonwa na duka.'],w:['Fewer “where is my order?” calls; proof of delivery for every parcel.','Simu chache za “oda yangu iko wapi?”; ushahidi wa kufikishwa kwa kila kifurushi.']},
 {k:'box',t:['Manage the Afya Box','Simamia Afya Box'],p:['Members see their next box, the date choices lock, and three simple controls: change a size, add an item, or pause a month. The price only changes when the customer chooses something that changes it.','Wanachama wanaona box lao lijalo, tarehe ya mwisho ya kubadilisha, na vidhibiti vitatu rahisi: badilisha saizi, ongeza bidhaa, au sitisha mwezi mmoja. Bei inabadilika tu mteja akichagua kitu kinachoibadilisha.'],w:['Self-service keeps members longer and keeps the store’s stock plan accurate.','Kujihudumia kunawaweka wanachama muda mrefu na kunafanya mpango wa stoo uwe sahihi.']},
 {k:'res',t:['See the Afya Check results','Ona majibu ya Afya Check'],p:['Readings from the in-store Afya Check Station arrive in the app with a plain-language note and the last six results in a simple table. They are screening results, not a diagnosis, and the app says when to see a clinician.','Vipimo kutoka Kituo cha Afya Check dukani vinafika kwenye programu pamoja na maelezo rahisi na majibu sita ya mwisho kwenye jedwali. Ni vipimo vya uchunguzi, si utambuzi wa ugonjwa, na programu inasema lini umwone mtaalamu.'],w:['A reason to open the app every month, beyond shopping.','Sababu ya kufungua programu kila mwezi, zaidi ya kununua.']},
 {k:'twin',t:['Afya Twin: our own system','Afya Twin: mfumo wetu wenyewe'],p:['A living picture of the household: who lives there, their stage of life, what they use and how fast, and their latest Afya Check readings. The refill radar predicts what runs out before it does, prepares the basket and lets the customer confirm in one tap or by voice in Kiswahili. Family abroad pay and see only what they are allowed to see.','Picha hai ya kaya: nani anaishi hapo, hatua yao ya maisha, wanachotumia na kwa kasi gani, na vipimo vyao vya karibuni vya Afya Check. Rada ya kujaza inatabiri kinachoisha kabla hakijaisha, inaandaa kikapu na kumruhusu mteja kuthibitisha kwa kubonyeza mara moja au kwa sauti kwa Kiswahili. Familia walioko nje wanalipa na kuona tu wanachoruhusiwa.'],w:['The customer never runs out, and the store knows next week’s demand today.','Mteja haishiwi kamwe, na duka linajua mahitaji ya wiki ijayo leo.']}
];
