const NOTES={
 ann:[['The promise bar','Ahadi ya juu'],['The first line every visitor reads states the two things that win in Dar es Salaam: speed and familiar payment. Mobile-money accounts passed 87 million in 2026, so we lead with M-Pesa, Mixx by Yas and Airtel Money rather than cards.','Mstari wa kwanza ambao kila mgeni anasoma unaeleza mambo mawili yanayoshinda Dar es Salaam: kasi na malipo yanayojulikana. Akaunti za pesa kwa simu zilipita milioni 87 mwaka 2026, hivyo tunaanza na M-Pesa, Mixx by Yas na Airtel Money badala ya kadi.'],[[['Mobile-money accounts','Akaunti za pesa kwa simu'],'87 m'],[['Delivery fee (model)','Ada ya usafirishaji (mpango)'],TS(ON.delivery_fee)],[['Rider cost per order (model)','Gharama ya msafirishaji kwa oda (mpango)'],TS(ON.rider_cost_per_order)]]],
 hdr:[['A store you already know','Duka unalolijua tayari'],['The menu mirrors the six Care Zones on the shop floor (A to F). A customer who has walked our aisles finds the same things in the same order online, and staff can guide people by phone using the same words.','Menyu inafuata Kanda sita za Huduma dukani (A hadi F). Mteja aliyetembea kwenye rafu zetu anapata vitu vile vile kwa mpangilio ule ule mtandaoni, na wafanyakazi wanaweza kuwaongoza watu kwa simu kwa maneno yale yale.'],[[['Care Zones','Kanda za Huduma'],'6 · A–F'],[['Product families','Familia za bidhaa'],'527']]],
 hero:[['Edits, not aisles','Mikusanyiko, si rafu'],['We merchandise through edits: one campaign per need, refreshed with the seasons set out in section 3.6. An edit sells a complete solution rather than a single item, which raises basket size.','Tunapanga bidhaa kwa mikusanyiko: kampeni moja kwa kila hitaji, inayobadilishwa kufuata misimu iliyoelezwa katika sehemu 3.6. Mkusanyiko unauza suluhisho kamili badala ya bidhaa moja, jambo linaloongeza ukubwa wa kikapu.'],[[['Online basket (model)','Kikapu cha mtandaoni (mpango)'],'TSh 35,000'],[['Store basket (model)','Kikapu cha dukani (mpango)'],'TSh 25,000']]],
 circ:[['Shop by need','Nunua kwa hitaji'],['Six circles for six needs. Each coloured letter is the zone code printed above the shelves, so online and in-store shopping follow the same layout.','Duara sita kwa mahitaji sita. Kila herufi yenye rangi ni namba ya kanda iliyochapishwa juu ya rafu, hivyo kununua mtandaoni na dukani kunafuata mpangilio mmoja.'],[]],
 rail:[['Real products, real prices','Bidhaa halisi, bei halisi'],['Every product here comes from the 3.6 catalogue, with a researched public price and its source. Each card says who the product is best for, which replaces the pharmacist conversation a customer would have in store.','Kila bidhaa hapa inatoka katalogi ya 3.6, ikiwa na bei ya wazi iliyotafitiwa na chanzo chake. Kila kadi inasema bidhaa inamfaa nani, jambo linalochukua nafasi ya mazungumzo na mfamasia dukani.'],[[['Product margin (model)','Faida ya bidhaa (mpango)'],'32%'],[['Gross profit per online order','Faida ghafi kwa oda ya mtandaoni'],TS(Math.round(RET(ON.basket,1)/100)*100)]]],
 split:[['Premium presentation','Mwonekano wa hadhi ya juu'],['Large photography, restrained typography and short copy present a health store with the credibility of a beauty brand. This positions Afya Basics between low-cost stalls and clinical pharmacies.','Picha kubwa, maandishi tulivu na maneno mafupi yanalipa duka la afya heshima ya chapa ya urembo. Hii inaiweka Afya Basics kati ya vibanda vya bei nafuu na maduka ya dawa ya kitabibu.'],[]],
 box:[['Recurring revenue','Mapato yanayojirudia'],[`The Afya Box turns one-off shoppers into monthly members. With the master model’s average box of ${TS(MB.avg_box)}, each member adds about ${TS(Math.round(BOXGP(MB.avg_box)/100)*100)} of gross profit a month after VAT, member discounts and packing and delivery at cost.`,`Afya Box inageuza wanunuzi wa mara moja kuwa wanachama wa kila mwezi. Kwa wastani wa box wa ${TS(MB.avg_box)} katika mpango mkuu, kila mwanachama anaongeza takriban ${TS(Math.round(BOXGP(MB.avg_box)/100)*100)} za faida ghafi kwa mwezi baada ya VAT, punguzo la wanachama na gharama za kufunga na kuleta kwa bei ya gharama.`],[[['Average box (model)','Wastani wa box (mpango)'],TS(MB.avg_box)],[['Gross profit per member a month','Faida ghafi kwa mwanachama kwa mwezi'],TS(Math.round(BOXGP(MB.avg_box)/100)*100)],[['Members leaving a month (model)','Wanaoondoka kwa mwezi (mpango)'],Math.round(MB.monthly_churn*100)+'%']]],
 tw:[['The reason families stay','Sababu familia zinabaki'],['The Afya Twin predicts what each person in a household will run out of and prepares the basket three days early. A household that does not run out has less reason to buy elsewhere. The full method and a live simulator appear further down this page.','Afya Twin inatabiri kile kila mtu katika kaya kitamwishia na kuandaa kikapu siku tatu kabla. Kaya isiyoishiwa ina sababu ndogo ya kununua kwingine. Mbinu kamili na kiigizaji hai viko chini zaidi kwenye ukurasa huu.'],[[['Average stay in months (model churn)','Wastani wa miezi ya kukaa (kiwango cha mpango)'],'≈ '+(1/MB.monthly_churn).toFixed(1)],[['Lifetime gross profit','Faida ghafi ya maisha'],TS(Math.round(BOXGP(MB.avg_box)/MB.monthly_churn/1000)*1000)]]],
 trust:[['Four reasons to trust us','Sababu nne za kutuamini'],['Verified packs, a pharmacist on WhatsApp, delivery with a code and payment with the customer’s own PIN. Each removes a fear that keeps people buying from the stall they know.','Pakiti zilizothibitishwa, mfamasia kwa WhatsApp, usafirishaji kwa namba ya siri na malipo kwa PIN ya mteja mwenyewe. Kila moja linaondoa hofu inayowafanya watu kununua kwenye kibanda wanachokijua.'],[]],
 app:[['Android first','Android kwanza'],['About 92% of smartphones in Tanzania run Android, so the Android app ships first and the iOS app follows. WhatsApp and the website open before either, because they need no download.','Takriban 92% ya simu janja Tanzania zinatumia Android, hivyo programu ya Android inatoka kwanza na ya iOS inafuata. WhatsApp na tovuti zinafunguliwa kabla ya zote mbili, kwa sababu hazihitaji kupakua.'],[[['Android share (StatCounter, Oct 2026)','Sehemu ya Android (StatCounter, Okt 2026)'],'92%'],[['Smartphones (TCRA, Jun 2026)','Simu janja (TCRA, Jun 2026)'],'31.3 m']]],
 ftr:[['Compliance stated on every page','Utii wa sheria unaonyeshwa kila ukurasa'],['Every page states the rules we keep: registration with the Personal Data Protection Commission, TRA electronic receipts, and no prescription-only medicines in digital channels.','Kila ukurasa unaeleza kanuni tunazofuata: usajili na Tume ya Ulinzi wa Taarifa Binafsi, risiti za kielektroniki za TRA, na hakuna dawa zinazohitaji cheti cha daktari katika njia za kidijitali.'],[]]};
